  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Economic Resilience Initiative in the Syria region</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To strengthen the resilience of countries impacted by the Syrian refugee crisis, particularly Jordan and Lebanon, through supporting new investment in key infrastructure and private sector development.  The UK&apos;s contribution will achieve this by making new investment in the region more economically viable and by supporting the preparation and implementation of new investments.</narrative>
  </description>
